<title>USA: Intelligent Electronics spins off XLConnect.</title>
<headline>Intelligent Electronics spins off XLConnect.</headline>
<dateline>EXTON, Pa. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intelligent Electronics Inc said on Thursday it is spinning off XLConnect Solutions Inc to the parent company's shareholders.</p>
<p>Intelligent Electronics will distribute 13,325.0 million XLConnect shares to Intelligent Electronics shareholders, conditioned on a pending Internal Revenue Service ruling that the action is tax-free. If approved, the spinoff should be completed by the end of the summer.</p>
</text>
